<title>SPAIN: Spain jobless rate rises to 14.08 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Spain jobless rate rises to 14.08 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Labour Ministry supplied the following figures:</p>
<p>  UNEMPLOYMENT	     OCT 96    SEPT 96	OCT 95</p>
<p> Total (million)	   2.23	    2.19	 2.39</p>
<p> Change on month	 +40,099	  +51,106    +14,490</p>
<p> Pct of workforce	  14.08	   13.82     15.41</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are based on registered unemployed.</p>
</text>
